p; brokers</span></span></a><a href="/industries/retail-ecommerce/"><span class="nm-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 2 3 6v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h14a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V6l-3-4z"/><path d="M3 6h18"/><path d="M16 10a4 4 0 0 1-8 0"/></svg></span><span class="nm-text"><b>Retail &amp; e-commerce</b><span>COD, orders &amp; festive sales</span></span></a><a href="/industries/travel-hospitality/"><span class="nm-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 2 11 13"/><path d="M22 2 15 22l-4-9-9-4z"/></svg></span><span class="nm-text"><b>Travel &amp; hospitality</b><span>Bookings, check-ins &amp; offers</span></span></a></div></div>
