; camps</span></a><a href="/industries/real-estate/"><b>Real estate</b><span>Site visits, launches &amp; brokers</span></a><a href="/industries/retail-ecommerce/"><b>Retail &amp; e-commerce</b><span>COD, orders &amp; festive sales</span></a><a href="/industries/travel-hospitality/"><b>Travel &amp; hospitality</b><span>Bookings, check-ins &amp; offers</span></a></div></div><a class="mnav-link" href="/pricing">Pricing</a><div class="mnav-group"><button class="mnav-toggle" type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span>Resources</span><svg class="chev" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" width="15" height="15" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></button><div class="mnav-sub"><a href="/solutions"><b>Solutions</b><span>Playbooks by business goal</span></a><a href="/free-tools"><b>Free tools</b><span>WhatsApp utilities, no cost</span></a><a href="/docs"><b>Docs</b><span>Developer &amp; setup guides</span></a><a href="/about"><b>About</b><span>Company, contact &amp; story</span></a></div></div><div class="mnav-cta"><a class="btn-ghost" href="/app">Log in</a><a class="btn" href="/app">Open the app</a></div></div>
