<main>

<section class="hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="hero-grid">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <p class="hero-eyebrow"><span class="dot"></span> Official WhatsApp Business API CRM</p>
        <h1>Automate the busywork.<br/>Keep <span class="hl hl-blush">every conversation</span> human.</h1>
        <p class="lead hero-lead">WebPing is the WhatsApp CRM for teams that sell and support in chat.
        A shared inbox for the whole team, scheduled broadcasts, automatic replies and a deal board —
        one login, one number, zero phone-switching.</p>
        <div class="btn-row">
          <a class="btn" href="/app">Start for free</a>
          <a class="btn-ghost" href="/pricing">See pricing</a>
        </div>
        <p class="fine">Free plan &middot; No credit card &middot; 1-day full refund</p>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-mock">
        <p class="tag-chip hot"><span class="dot" style="width:8px;height:8px;background:#e11d48;border-radius:50%;display:inline-block;margin-right:8px"></span> New message &middot; WhatsApp</p>
        <div class="bmsg">Hi! Do you deliver to Nagpur? And what does shipping cost for two units?</div>
        <div class="mock-row-dim"><span class="avatar">L</span><span class="meta-row" style="margin-top:0">Luke &middot; 09:38</span></div>
        <div class="cmsg">We do — same-day dispatch to Nagpur. Here's the catalogue, and you'll get
        tracking updates right here in this chat.</div>
        <div class="mock-row" style="justify-content:flex-end"><span class="meta-row meta-row-right" style="margin-top:0">Auto-reply &middot; sent in 2s</span></div>
        <div class="mock-glass"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="drift d1" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#25d366" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 11.5a8.4 8.4 0 0 1-8.5 8.4 8.7 8.7 0 0 1-3.8-.9L3 20l1-5.1a8.2 8.2 0 0 1-1-4A8.4 8.4 0 0 1 11.5 3a8.4 8.4 0 0 1 9.5 8.5z" fill="rgba(37,211,102,.12)"/><path d="M8.2 10.7c.5 1.8 2 3.6 4 4.6"/></svg></div>
  <div class="drift d2" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#0e9f57" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 7v5l3.2 2"/></svg></div>
  <div class="trust-strip"><div class="wrap">
    <p class="trust-copy">Trusted to handle <strong>every customer conversation</strong> on the official
    <strong>WhatsApp Business Platform</strong> — on <strong>your own server</strong>.</p>
    <div class="trust-chips">
      <span class="chip-badge"><i></i> Cloud API ready</span>
      <span class="chip-badge b2"><i></i> Self-hosted data</span>
      <span class="chip-badge b3"><i></i> 1-day full refund</span>
    </div>
  </div></div>
</section>

<section class="section sec-white">
  <div class="wrap orbit-wrap">
    <div>
      <p class="kicker">One place</p>
      <h2>Every conversation, one shared inbox.</h2>
      <p class="lead">Take the WhatsApp number your customers already message and put your entire
      sales and support team behind it. When a visitor lands on your site instead, the
      chat button waits for them there too.</p>
      <ul class="pi-list">
        <li><span class="tick"></span><span><b>Shared team inbox</b> with assignment, tags, statuses and internal notes that can never send.</span></li>
        <li><span class="tick"></span><span><b>Live 24-hour window timer</b> that flips the composer to approved templates the moment Meta's window closes.</span></li>
        <li><span class="tick"></span><span><b>Contacts with history</b> — tags, custom fields and the full thread beside every chat.</span></li>
      </ul>
      <div class="btn-row"><a class="btn" href="/app">Connect your first number</a><a class="btn-ghost" href="/features/shared-inbox">Explore the inbox &rarr;</a></div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <div class="orbit" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="orbit-ring"></div>
        <div class="orbit-ring r2"></div>
        <div class="orbit-ring r3"></div>
        <div class="orbit-center"><img src="/favicon.svg" alt="WebPing" /></div>
        <div class="orbit-item o1" style="color:#25d366">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="30" height="30" fill="none" stroke="#25d366" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 11.5a8.4 8.4 0 0 1-8.5 8.4 8.7 8.7 0 0 1-3.8-.9L3 20l1-5.1a8.2 8.2 0 0 1-1-4A8.4 8.4 0 0 1 11.5 3a8.4 8.4 0 0 1 9.5 8.5z" fill="rgba(37,211,102,.12)" stroke-width="1.6"/><path d="M8.2 10.7c.5 1.8 2 3.6 4 4.6"/><path d="M12 15.6c.4.4 1 .6 1.5.3"/></svg>
          <span class="olabel" style="color:#0b7a44">WhatsApp</span>
        </div>
        <div class="orbit-item o2">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="30" height="30" fill="none" stroke="#54565a" stroke-width="1.8"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M3 12h18M12 3c2.8 2.6 4 6 4 9s-1.2 6.4-4 9c-2.8-2.6-4-6-4-9s1.2-6.4 4-9z"/></svg>
          <span class="olabel">Web chat</span>
        </div>
        <div class="orbit-item o3 api"><span style="font-weight:800;font-size:.95rem;color:#0b7a44;border:1.5px dashed rgba(14,159,87,.4);border-radius:12px;padding:7px 12px">API</span><span class="olabel">Developer API</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section sec-lav">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr;gap:44px;align-items:end">
      <div>
        <p class="kicker">One CRM, many jobs</p>
        <h2>Fuel every stage of the customer journey.</h2>
      </div>
      <p style="color:var(--sub);font-size:1.05rem;margin:0">From the first "hi?" to the renewal,
      WebPing turns conversations into pipeline, faster deals and customers who come back.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="jt-bar" role="tablist">
      <button class="jt-tab active" data-pane="mkt" type="button">Marketing</button>
      <button class="jt-tab" data-pane="sales" type="button">Sales</button>
      <button class="jt-tab" data-pane="support" type="button">Support</button>
    </div>
    <div class="jt-panes">

      <div class="jt-pane active" id="pane-mkt">
        <div>
          <h3>Broadcasts that follow Meta's rules.</h3>
          <p>Scheduled, approved templates sent to audience lists — paced to your number's
          messaging tier so compliance never becomes a problem. Every reply re-opens the
          24-hour conversation, which is where revenue actually happens.</p>
          <div class="metric-cards">
            <div class="metric-card"><b>Paced</b><span>per messaging tier</span></div>
            <div class="metric-card"><b>Lists</b><span>with audience filters</span></div>
            <div class="metric-card"><b>1 tap</b><span>to schedule</span></div>
          </div>
          <div class="btn-row"><a class="btn" href="/features/broadcasts">Explore broadcasts &rarr;</a></div>
        </div>
        <div class="shot ab-shot" role="img" aria-label="Animated demo on a WhatsApp-style mobile screen: a paced broadcast template is delivered, a reply arrives and opens the 24-hour window; pacing, audience lists and one-tap scheduling float around the phone">
        <div class="ab-phone">
          <i class="ab-notch"></i>
          <div class="ab-screen">
            <div class="ab-phhead">
              <span class="ab-back"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M15 18l-6-6 6-6"/></svg></span>
              <span class="ab-pavatar">W</span>
              <div class="ab-pwho"><b>WebPing</b><span>Business &middot; WhatsApp API</span></div>
              <span class="ab-ptier">Paced &middot; Tier 2</span>
            </div>
            <div class="ab-phbody">
              <span class="ab-stamp">Today &middot; 10:00</span>
              <div class="ab-msg ab-msg-out">Weekly drop is live &mdash; 20% off all tees this weekend. Reply here for sizes.<span class="ab-meta">promo_10_v3 &middot; template<svg class="ab-ticks" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m18 6-7.2 7.2L8 10.6"/><path d="m14.6 13.6-1.8 1.8L10 12.6"/></svg></span></div>
              <div class="ab-pace"><i></i><span>1,600 msgs/hr &middot; per tier</span></div>
